// character_overrides.json — hand-authored personalities for Calradia Remembers.
//
// Enable in Mod Options -> Calradia Remembers -> Character -> "Use custom traits".
// When on, each entry below REPLACES that NPC's five vanilla personality traits, so the prompt's
// derived persona, the trait-derived features (kinks, etc.), and the campaign AI all read your values.
// Turning the toggle off restores the vanilla traits. After editing, load your save (or run cr.reload_lore).
//
// Each entry:
//   "hero"        display name to match (case-insensitive)
//   "id"          OPTIONAL StringId, to disambiguate two NPCs with the same name
//   "valor", "honor", "mercy", "generosity", "calculating"   each -2..+2; omit one to keep its vanilla value
//   "backstory"   OPTIONAL free text — roleplay flavor only (color, not behaviour; conduct still follows traits)
//
// Example (uncomment the array below to enable it):
// [
//   {
//     "hero": "Derthert",
//     "valor": 1,
//     "honor": -1,
//     "calculating": 2,
//     "backstory": "A Vlandian king who trusts ledgers more than men, and remembers every debt."
//   }
// ]
[]
